s%20before%20any%20initializer%20runs.%20A%20read%0A%20%2A%20resolves%20to%20the%20nearest%20binding%2C%20including%20a%20parameter%20or%20constant%20shadow.%0A%20%2A%20Only%20simple%20let%20bindings%20add%20this%20check%3B%20their%20initializer%20must%20finish%20before%0A%20%2A%20the%20read.%20A%20closure%27s%20original%20read%20remains%20conservative%20when%20no%20invocation-%0A%20%2A%20order%20proof%20exists.%20Named%20functions%20and%20defaults%20do%20not%20represent%20mutable%0A%20%2A%20module%20captures%2C%20in%20either%20textual%20order.%20No%20expression%2FASI%20boundary%20is%20guessed.%0A%20%2A%20Scope%20bounds%20are%20ordered%20start%2Fcount%2Fboundary%20triples%20%280%20ordinary%2C%201%20closure%2C%0A%20%2A%202%20named%20function%20or%20default%29.%20A%20negative%0A%20%2A%20binding%20end%20denotes%20a%20shadow%20whose%20existing%20parser%20check%20owns%20initialization%0A%20%2A%20validation.%20A%20refusal%20is%20%5Bread%20index%2C%20issue%5D%3A%200%20local%20timing%2C%201%20closure%20timing%2C%0A%20%2A%202%20unrepresented%20mutable%20module%20capture%3B%20otherwise%20%5B%5D.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20parents%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20bounds%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20names%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20ends%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20readScopes%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20readNames%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20readStarts%0A%20%2A%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptTemporalBindingRead%28parents%2C%20bounds%2C%20names%2C%20ends%2C%20readScopes%2C%20readNames%2C%20readStarts%29%20%7B%0A%20%20for%20%28let%20read%20%3D%200%3B%20read%20%3C%20readNames.length%3B%20read%20%2B%3D%201%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20scope%20%3D%20readScopes%5Bread%5D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20bound%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20captured%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%20%20%20%20let%20moduleRead%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%20%20%20%20while%20%28scope%20%3E%3D%200%20%26%26%20%21bound%